//MCQ

::Data Frame::
Which of the following file formats stores the data in key-value pairs?{
    ~ Text files and CSV files
    = JSON files and Avro files
    ~ Parquet files
    ~ ORC files
} 

::Data Frame::
Which of the following file gives the best read performance?{
    ~ CSV
    ~ Avro
    = Parquet
    ~ RC
}

::Data Frame::
Which of the following file gives the best write performance?{
    ~ CSV
    = Avro
    ~ Parquet
    ~ RC
}

::Data Frame::
Which files are best suited to store the intermediate data of mapper in hadoop?{
    ~ CSV file
    ~ Avro file
    ~ JSON file
    = Sequence file
}

::Data Frame::
Which file format is best if the schema of the data is going to change over time?{
    ~ RC files
    ~ ORC files
    ~ Sequence files
    = Avro files
}

